{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:960972b9df59d8f0","name":"Gamma-Class Assault Shuttle","source":{"id":"source:reference-960972b9df59d8f0","title":"Gamma-Class Assault Shuttle","revision":18706,"timestamp":"2024-08-25T20:35:37Z","sha256":"250a14f1eae0e603faea5c78b87bc31975105f3f2fc19be46d23913652f9af39","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=18706","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Gamma-Class%20Assault%20Shuttle&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-960972b9df59d8f0","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Starships of the Galaxy"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Starships_of_the_Galaxy"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Assault Shuttles, unlike their standard counterparts, are designed specifically to carry troops into battle. Telgorn Corp's ",{"tag":"i","children":["Gamma"]},"-Class Assault Shuttle is an excellent example of such a ship. It is well regarded by both Imperial officers and troops, due in part to its effectiveness and resilience to damage. The shuttle has some of the heaviest deflector shields of any ship in the Imperial Navy, and nearly sixty-two percent of its power output is funneled directly into them.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Since its introduction, the ",{"tag":"i","children":["Gamma"]},"-Class Assault Shuttle has been used primarily to assist in the boarding and capture of enemy vessels and space facilities. It accommodates Imperial ",{"tag":"a","children":["Spacetroopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Spacetroopers"}," quite well, allowing them easy access to their armor, as well as convenient hatchways to expedite their entry and egress from the shuttle's main cabin.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Capabilities"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["The shuttle's crew requirements are a ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicle Pilot"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicle_Pilot","referenceId":"reference:4aff6d0e54fff36e"},", a navigator, and three ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"},". Two ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunners"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunners"}," control the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Turbolasers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Turbolasers"},", while the third ",{"tag":"a","children":["Gunner"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Gunner","referenceId":"reference:0cbc0bc5729f801f"}," operates the ",{"tag":"a","children":["Concussion Missile Launcher"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Concussion_Missile_Launcher"}," and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tractor Beam"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tractor_Beam","referenceId":"reference:627f44a03c76e65b"},". Its shields are incredibly powerful, but the shuttle's generator can't support them under a sustained assault; the shields automatically lose 5 points of SR from every successful attack (not just those that penetrate its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},"), and SR is reduced to 0 if any attack deals damage that equals or exceeds its current ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["When it is utilized in boarding actions, the shuttle's primary tactic is to disable the enemy vessel using a combination of pinpoint blaster and ion bursts. Once a target has been rendered immobile, the shuttle clamps onto it with its ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tractor Beam"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tractor_Beam","referenceId":"reference:627f44a03c76e65b"}," and gets close enough to dock so it can deploy its troops. In other situations, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Spacetroopers"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Spacetroopers"}," are deployed through their hatchways and sent to the enemy ship under their own power. All the while, the shuttle provides covering fire as the troopers close the distance.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Default (Skilled)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Gamma"]},"-Class Assault Shuttle Statistics (CL 15)"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Colossal ",{"tag":"a","children":["Space Transport"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Space_Transport"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +0; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +6\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 17 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 13), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 28; +13 Armor, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Vehicular Combat"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Vehicular_Combat","referenceId":"reference:31246426131b3457"},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 360; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Reduction"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Reduction"},": 15; ",{"tag":"a","children":["Shield Rating"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Shield_Rating"},": 230 (See Above); ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 78\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","childr